{"id":2603,"bodyHtml":"<DIV><div><p>为引导学生打破刻板标签、摆脱自我设限、树立积极自我认知，呵护学生心理健康，2026年5月23日，经济与管理学院心理辅导站在文瀛食堂开展“撕掉我的标签”主题心理趣味活动，以沉浸式互动助力学生悦纳自我、突破成长。活动现场设置特色标签展板，张贴有“不自信”“容易内耗”等各类负面、固化标签。同学们踊跃参与，主动撕下束缚自我的标签，直面心理桎梏、打破固有认知，勇敢告别自我局限，在互动中释放自我、舒缓心绪。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mn7lNaUmLPMzMkMTmvbM4Q7Uz-iM7ntRUmvYM4M7nmlPLzv0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyiLkyPMky4MNrknmrRM7rRM7CbMNUbnNn7nzARozCaoznFnNU8oln7nzfFU4rfL4lJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLig4-8LRlbgtA8pUjcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=24059&e=.png\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/C501436EBF5C4EC4F96D9FDDE8C96094/FD49DDE0/C5A35\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 314px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mUmrNfL4MRn7MfMT4W2M4WRUlVkLlMtVn77DUlC4LllPM8L0gihFp2hmCIa0MSy8okhRMYybMz-aMmMkUmMRoRlaLmL8o7-Yo7-ioRM2nlnFM4UsLmn2U8rFLmlYoR6fgjfJQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4MSyYMRGioSbw62j8c&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=24059&e=.png\"></p><p>活动的核心亮点为“蝴蝶立牌”创意环节。同学们将撕下的负面标签转化为蝴蝶翅膀意象，寓意挣脱偏见枷锁、放下自我内耗，实现自我接纳、破茧成蝶的成长蜕变。现场氛围温暖治愈，让同学们重拾自信，收获奋勇前行的动力，有效提升了学生的心理调适能力，助力学生塑造健康阳光的心态。经济与管理学院心理辅导站将持续聚焦学生心理健康成长，持续开展多样化心理教育活动，丰富心理育人形式，筑牢学生心理健康防线，助力学子向阳成长、逐梦前行。</p><p><img src=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mLNVNkMNV7U8rknTllYnmf7nRUiUm9tZL7L8L4W7L4UYMmU0gihFp2hmCIa0LkybLYy8oSyPolV2LmVVMzCDnzTRU467UNlDLRl8oz9sMlnFol7YLmCiLmnFM7-ZUzlJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4MSyYMRGioSbw62j8c&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=24059&e=.jpeg\" vsbhref=\"vurl\" vurl=\"/_vsl/0934919AF21E566E9CC7DBE60549875D/9A226524/4B8A5\" vheight=\"\" vwidth=\" 408px\" alt=\"\" orisrc=\"/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mLNVNkMNV7U8rknTllYnmf7nRUiUm9tZL7L8L4W7L4UYMmU0gihFp2hmCIa0LkybLYy8oSyPolV2LmVVMzCDnzTRU467UNlDLRl8oz9sMlnFol7YLmCiLmnFM7-ZUzlJqjfTQ4Oeo4x/qjTjpdAbgDTJQty0LzG4MSyYMRGioSbw62j8c&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=24059&e=.jpeg\"></p><p><br></p></div></DIV>","bodyText":"","attachments":[],"image":"http://jgy.nuc.edu.cn/virtual_attach_file.vsb?afc=mn7lNaUmLPMzMkMTmvbM4Q7Uz-iM7ntRUmvYM4M7nmlPLzv0gihFp2hmCIa0UYyiLkyPMky4MNrknmrRM7rRM7CbMNUbnNn7nzARozCaoznFnNU8oln7nzfFU4rfL4lJv2bjo4OeoDX/_I6O_dN0qIbtpYyPLRLig4-8LRlbgtA8pUjcc&oid=1280026481&tid=1035&nid=24059&e=.png"}